      <p style="margin: 6px 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5;">
        <a href="http://www.ceskatelevize.cz/porady/10435049455-dobre-rano/318291310020027/video/607220,607227,607238" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #bc2938;"><strong style="font-weight: 500;">Česká televize</strong></a> / Dobré ráno
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 6px 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5;">
