      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 20px;">🎓 Vzdělávám se</h2>
      <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5; color: #bc2938;">
        <li><strong style="font-weight: 500;">Ing.</strong> – VŠE, Národohospodářská fakulta</li>
        <li><strong style="font-weight: 500;">Grafický design</strong> – Scholastika</li>
        <li><strong style="font-weight: 500;">UX design</strong> – Czechitas</li>
        <li><strong style="font-weight: 500;">HTML/CSS</strong> – Czechitas</li>
        <li><strong style="font-weight: 500;">Umělecká fotografie</strong> – Matela Studio</li>
        <li><strong style="font-weight: 500;">Business English</strong> – M.L.S. International College (UK)</li>
        <li><strong style="font-weight: 500;">Yoga Teacher Training</strong> – Dej si pokoj</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
